CapabilitiesRegistry
├── whitelistCapability
│   ├── only the registry owner may replace or clear selectors
│   ├── snapshots unauthorized replacement without changing approval
│   ├── nonempty lists can be approved without deployed capability code
│   ├── replaces the entire list, including shortening and clearing it
│   ├── an empty list revokes approval even if capability code is missing
│   ├── emits the exact account, capability, and replacement selectors
│   └── snapshots new, replacement, cleared and restored approvals with isolated calls
└── selectors
    ├── returns the complete selector list, or an empty list for an unapproved pair
    ├── keeps approvals independent across accounts and capabilities
    └── snapshots empty and configured reads
